		{
			dependencies: ["38DC97E4D4193BDC"]
			description: [
				"&eFusion Crafting&r is how every Draconic item above the first tier is made: a &7Crafting Core&r surrounded by &7Injectors&r, fed enormous amounts of FE."
				""
				"&e&lThe build:&r place the Core, put Injectors in line with it (any distance, any direction), put an ingredient in each injector and the catalyst in the core, then power the injectors and start it."
				""
				"&e&lInjector tiers must match the recipe tier.&r A Basic injector cannot supply a Wyvern recipe. The core's GUI tells you what is missing rather than failing silently."
				""
				"&c&lIt needs a great deal of energy per craft&r - this is what an Energy Core is actually for. Trying to fusion-craft off a wind farm will take real-world hours."
				""
				"&7Set this up once and leave it. Every tier from here passes through the same structure.&r"
			]
			icon: "draconicevolution:crafting_core"
			id: "1CE4A6719F183DCD"
			rewards: [{
				id: "44CCFB72F6D4C46E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The multiblock everything uses"
