					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&5Fusion Crafting"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The &eEnergy Core&r is a tiered multiblock holding absurd amounts of FE - tier 1 is a single block, tier 8 is a vast sphere."
				""
				"&e&lUse the in-game build guide.&r Right-click the core with the placement tool and it renders a ghost of exactly where every block goes. Do not attempt tier 4+ from memory."
				""
				"&c&lPylons are the only input and output, and they default to input.&r A core that appears to swallow power and give none back has no pylon set to output - right-click a pylon to toggle it."
				""
				"&7Wireless Energy Crystals move power in and out without cable, which is how most people feed one.&r"
				""
				"&8Tier 3 or 4 is plenty to buffer a fission reactor. The higher tiers are for fusion reactors and showing off."
			]
			icon: "draconicevolution:energy_core"
			id: "6AF1841A5A0C52CF"
			rewards: [{
				id: "51C69BA58ADF93CC"
