			title: "&5Chaos Shards"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&eAwakened Draconium&r is made by fusion-crafting draconium with a Nether Star at the highest tier - the material every endgame Draconic item needs."
				""
				"&7In this pack Nether Stars are repeatable through Hostile Neural Networks and Mystical Agriculture, so this is a grind rather than a wall.&r"
				""
				"&8Awakened blocks are also part of the highest Energy Core tiers, so budget for far more than your tools need."
			]
