		{
			description: [
				"&5&lDraconic Evolution is the pack's parallel endgame.&r"
				""
				"The Heart of the Sky is the win condition, but this is the power fantasy - flight, a regenerating shield, a pickaxe that removes rooms, and a reactor that could power everything you will ever build or level your island, depending on how carefully you wired it."
				""
				"&c&lRemember the Draconium Core that started this chapter is pinned with a Silver Dungeon Key.&r None of this existed until you killed the Valkyrie Queen."
			]
